Subject: [PATCH 21/27] Volume keys: the brightness card whenever Menu is held
 at the press, read from the gamepad's key state

input_sense runs "brightness" instead of "volume" for the volume keys while the function key (Menu, BTN_MODE on the RG
DS) is held. volume.c now reads that key's state at each press (EVIOCGKEY on the gamepad's evdev node: no events are
taken from anyone) and shows the brightness card at once, also at the end of the scale where the setting doesn't
change; the setting-change check stays as the fallback for a gamepad without BTN_MODE. Nothing here touches the audio:
a press costs a read of system.cfg every 50 ms for 1.2 s.

